'''Candidate Aura''' was a mayoral candidate that served between the Year 458 and 468 [[Mayor Election]]s. While she was in the office, regular elections were replaced with [[Minister Election]]s.

== Mayoral Perks ==
Most mayors run with up to four unique perks, but '''Candidate Aura''' has only been seen with three perks and a note: "*few extra details not worth mentioning."

{{MayorPerks|Aura}}

=== UI ===
{{/UI}}

=== Fundraising ===
While '''Mayor Aura'''{{'}}s {{AN|Fundraising}} perk was active, several additional costs were incurred:
* Sending any message costs {{c|7}} each time (also applies in [[Stranded]]).
* Using [[Fast Travel]] costs {{c|2000}} each time (except for the [[Hub]], [[Private Island]], and [[Garden]]).
* [[Bazaar]] tax and [[Slayer]] spawn costs are doubled.
* Upgrading pets at {{NPCSprite|Kat}} costs {{Green|50%}} more {{c}}.
* Certain [[Dungeon]] drops have increased cost.

