=== Minion Union ===
This perk actually reduced minion speed by {{Green|33%}} ({{Additive}}).

This perk was disabled by minister {{rn|yt|im_a_squid_kid}}.

=== Universal Income ===
This perk states that {{Green|100%}} of coins gathered via {{AN|Fundraising}} are redistributed equally when in reality it is dictated by this formula:

<math>\text{Universal Income} = \left\lfloor\frac{\text{Fundraising Coins}}{\text{Unique Logins at Current Hour}}\right\rfloor \times \left(\frac{\text{Seconds of Playtime at Current Hour}}{3600\text{ seconds}}\right)</math>

=== Work Better ===
{{Sectionstub|incomplete list of items with boosted chances}}
This perk granted {{Stat|Magic Find|+50}} and {{Stat|Tracking|+25}} globally. All [[RNG Meter|{{Pink|RNG Meter}}]] progress was doubled, and the base drop rate of several items from the {{Zone|Crystal Nucleus}} and {{Zone|The Catacombs}} were increased. Items affected included:

* {{Item|Necron's Handle}}
* {{Item|Divan's Alloy}}
* {{Item|Quick Claw}}
<!--Please add more-->

=== Work Harder ===
This perk increased the {{Stat|hp}} and {{Stat|dmg}} of mobs by {{Green|10%}}.

This perk was re-enabled by minister {{rn|VIP|Aura_Stay}} after being disabled by minister {{rn|mvp+|Confused_Goon}}.

=== Work Smarter ===
This perk increased all Skill, [[Dungeons|Dungeon]], and [[Slayer]] XP by {{Green|+50%}}.

This perk was re-enabled by minister {{rn|YouTube|ALAND_}} after being disabled by minister {{rn|mvp++|SnowflakeKiwi}}.

== Ministers ==
{{Main|Minister Election}} 
Each year, '''Candidate Aura''' held a minister election from Late Spring 30th to Winter 7th, where the SkyBlock community elected their fellow players. Those with the top 7 votes were elected as ministers and got to choose their perks. Ministers who place on the podium, as well as ministers who attempt to remove Aura's perks, cannot be voted for in subsequent elections.

For perk rotations from ministers who chose the Perkpocalypse perk, see [[Candidate Aura/Perkpocalypse]].

