== Trivia ==
* '''Candidate Aura'''{{'}}s actual perks were revealed through the SkyBlock API prior to them being elected.<ref>https://archive.today/2025.11.25-112520/https://api.hypixel.net/v2/resources/skyblock/election</ref><ref>https://archive.today/2025.11.28-011340/https://api.hypixel.net/v2/resources/skyblock/election</ref>
**Tablist also shows Aura as having 6 perks.
*The dialogue starts from a random point, but is otherwise always in the same order.
* '''Candidate Aura''' has broken the record for most votes received by a candidate in SkyBlock's history, reaching over {{Green|1.5m}} votes on November 28th, 2025.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Un9h4iux7I&t=42</ref><ref>https://skyblockelections.com/articles/aura-breaks-records.html</ref>
* Upon initial release, the {{AN|Work Smarter}} perk was also granting {{Stat|Magic Find|+50}} in the [[Rift]].
* Some candidates were removed after gaining an unfair advantage.
** {{RankName|Mvp+|hannibal2}} is the creator of the SkyHanni mod.<ref>[[mod:skyhanni|SkyHanni]]</ref> He was blacklisted from the elections due to hannibal2's name being automatically filled in on behalf of the user, assuming they had not edited their vote.<ref>https://github.com/hannibal002/SkyHanni/pull/4902/files#diff-04bfba630aef7d49024d0e7edfb966a85c329773b844efd5e0388ced54d7447d</ref>
** {{RankName|Mvp+|duoplurk}} was blacklisted after a {{c}} giveaway was hosted to bribe votes.
*Using {{code|/killaura}} command when '''Aura''' isn't mayor returns {{red|Aura is not mayor.}}.

